            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Controller 1.0.51 (97)

SwiftDroid and Factory Droid updates for Mac, iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, and Android.

- Add SwiftDroid in Mac Settings and connect it to ChatGPT, Gemini, the Anthropic API, or your installed Claude Code. Choose a model from the connected account and start a Build or a resumable Mission.
- Use a paired iPhone, iPad, or Android device to follow SwiftDroid progress, respond to approvals, send follow-ups, stop work, and return to the same conversation. Provider credentials stay on the Mac.
- Factory Droid SDK accounts can run Workstreams and configure role models and validation stages.
- Finished conversations release their managed worktrees.
]]></description>
