            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Controller 1.0.51 (96)

Fixes for Mac, iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, and Android.

- Long Markdown tables no longer freeze the Mac app while they lay out, and table cells with long text wrap instead of stretching into one wide line. Tables on iPhone and iPad wrap long cells too.
- Settings → Connect no longer warns that a healthy Mac's address timed out.
- Connect Repos stops retrying a push that is too large for Connect and explains why it stopped.
- Agent Memory keeps syncing between Macs when one project's memory can't be merged.
]]></description>
